            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bethany"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Although I like chocolate, I’m not exactly a “chocolate lover”....so, I layered mini chocolate chips and fresh strawberries diced in small pieces. The strawberry really complimented the cream cheeses &amp; chocolate.",
