              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Missouri Farm Wife"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This seemed ideal for a small, sweet dessert. Since I was out of chocolate chips. I substituted Heath Bar chips and drizzled chocolate on top. Like the idea of using low fat cream cheese - this has a lot of possibilities depending on the contents of my cupboard. (We live miles from the nearest store, so don't make trips for one item!)",
